  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 46028713102ba8249a86dd438569ce41, type: 3}
  m_Name: RichGuyDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RichGuyDialogue
  talkLinesImposter:
  - Get out of my face, Captain.
  - Do I really look like a deep-sea parasite to you?
  talkClueTemplates:
  - If you must know, {name} spent too long in the bathroom.
  - I know nothing about {name} dancing in our quarters.
  - '{name} really thought arguing with {deadCharacter} was a good idea. Who cares
    that {deadCharacter} is dead, though.'
  - '{name} kept begging me for money. I said no.'
  talkLinesFallback:
  - This was the worst trip I ever had, Captain.
  - I could have done something more productive in that time.
  inspectLineImposter: Rich Guy is usually a jerk, but now he is a lot more of a
    jerk than usual. Stress or suspicious?
  inspectLineInnocent: Rich Guy is a jerk, he usually does not want to respect anyone,
    not even his wife.
  day0:
  - Hold on- What?
  - Is it something important, Captain?
  - No? Then stop interrupting my call.
